, lines 39-47","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/22-800_6j36.pdf","page_label":"file page 140, lines 39-47"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 4, lines 23-33","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/22-800_6j36.pdf","page_label":"file page 4, lines 23-33"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 56, lines 31-7","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/22-800_6j36.pdf","page_label":"file page 56, lines 31-7"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 65, lines 49-27","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/22-800_6j36.pdf","page_label":"file page 65, lines 49-27"}]},{"heading":"What the justices asked","paragraphs":["Justice Sotomayor asked why partners face similar taxes. She questioned the fairness of this attribution.","Justice Barrett asked if the issue is due process. She distinguished this from the definition of income."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 10, lines 21-27","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/22-800_6j36.pdf","page_label":"file page 10, lines 21-27"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 10, lines 41-49","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/22-800_6j36.pdf","page_label":"file page 10, lines 41-49"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 11, lines 47-53","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2023/22-800_6j36.pdf","page_label":"file page 11, lines 47-53"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file p